WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.959
My name is Harriet M. Welsch,

00:00:02.041 --> 00:00:04.667
and I want to be a writer. I have to know everything,

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.625
and to know everything I have to see everything

00:00:07.709 --> 00:00:10.875
only way to see everything is to be a spy.

00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:15.375
I just found a big story I need both of you to help me.

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:16.166
Oh, we’re in.

00:00:16.291 --> 00:00:17.458
You just got to know where to look.

00:00:20.041 --> 00:00:22.834
For something this daring rules will have to be broken.

00:00:22.917 --> 00:00:26.792
If Mr. Horatio finds out you’ve wondered off your future will be in detention.

00:00:26.917 --> 00:00:28.375
So, you better cover for me.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.083
Doomed, we’re all doomed!

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.208
One, two three, one, two, three

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:46.333
You are leading not following like young ladies are supposed to.

00:00:46.417 --> 00:00:47.875
Girls can lead too.

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:54.375
If the story leads you follow.

00:00:55.542 --> 00:00:57.750
Truly bit the biscuit on my mission.

00:00:57.834 --> 00:01:00.375
You’ve got to start looking out for people besides yourself.

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:04.125
I messed everything up, maybe we can fix it.

00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:14.709
I must say old bean your mustache looks positively dashing.

00:01:14.792 --> 00:01:18.125
Thank you good sir, it took ever so long to grow.

00:01:18.792 --> 00:01:21.083
This is a revolution!

00:01:23.001 --> 00:01:26.125
I’m glad I’m not perfect, I’d be bored to death.

